 It resolves when030 exists. I held it at the true end state deliberately; a 23-of-30 manifest would reintroduce the same mismatch.\n\n## What I'd recommend\n\nRestarting now is the highest-value move. 016–022 are verified on disk and won't be lost. A fresh session appears to have a much lower corruption rate — the 15 Codex-corrected files are clean, and my very first clean files this session came after restarts too.\n\nSuggested handoff:\n\n> ROLE=C, `APPEND_COMMON_SOLO_15`. Write only to `runtime/continue-to-15/collected/C`. `ROLE-C-016`〜`ROLE-C-022` (HTML+JSON) are complete and verified — do not touch them, read `ROLE-C-022.*` for format. Create `ROLE-C-023`〜`ROLE-C-030` (HTML+JSON), all `全マップ共通`, normal Skills, solo-only. Designs ready: 023 two-step attack, 024 interrupt a stun, 025 tread silently, 026 silence steps in water, 027 poison, 028 sidestep while flinching, 029 pull a target in, 030 return a stored blow. Then update manifest/index/progress/events/handoff to 30. Write each file, then read it back before moving on.\n\nIf you'd rather I keep going in this session, say so and I'll continue straight through 030 — but expect several files to need repair passes, and I'd report exactly which IDs I couldn't get clean."}}}},{"id":"cmuv3y8o6ddwkoa556ue0pw9y","createdAt":1791196168037,"role":"agent","raw":{"role":"agent","content":{"type":"acp","provider":"opencode","data":{"type":"token_count","id":"8a7649cd-cb73-4c3f-9e65-c802255fdb7e","key":"opencode-session:ses_efaa60f92ffdFJxbeuAJbE0kwC","used":136862,"size":200000,"model":"opencode/space-bunny-free","cost":{"total":0}}}}},{"id":"cmuv3y8w8ddwnoa55by1rsdic","createdAt":1791196168327,"role":"agent","raw":{"role":"agent","content":{"type":"acp","provider":"opencode","data":{"type":"token_count","id":"d2c9af7b-3e40-46cc-b792-d0e20ec85911","key":"opencode-session:ses_efaa60f92ffdFJxbeuAJbE0kwC","used":136862,"size":200000,"model":"opencode/space-bunny-free","cost":{"total":0}}}}},{"id":"cmuv3y9arddwsoa556q36cq01",